msgid ""
"Clear breakpoint at specified line or function.\n"
"Argument may be line number, function name, or \"*\" and an address.\n"
"If line number is specified, all breakpoints in that line are cleared.\n"
"If function is specified, breakpoints at beginning of function are cleared.\n"
"If an address is specified, breakpoints at that address are cleared.\n"
"\n"
"With no argument, clears all breakpoints in the line that the selected frame\n"
"is executing in.\n"
"\n"
"See also the \"delete\" command which clears breakpoints by number."
msgstr ""
"Rensa brytpunkt vid angiven rad eller funktion. Argumentet kan vara radnummer, funktionsnamn eller \"*\" och en adress. Om radnummer anges rensas alla brytpunkter i den raden.\n"
"Om en funktion anges raderas brytpunkter i början av funktionen. Om en adress anges raderas brytpunkter vid den adressen. Utan argument raderas alla brytpunkter i den rad som den valda ramen exekveras i. Se även kommandot \"delete\" som raderar brytpunkter efter nummer."

msgid ""
"Clone inferior ID.\n"
"Usage: clone-inferior [-copies <N>] [ID]\n"
"Add N copies of inferior ID.  The new inferior has the same\n"
"executable loaded as the copied inferior.  If -copies is not specified,\n"
"adds 1 copy.  If ID is not specified, it is the current inferior\n"
"that is cloned."
msgstr ""
"Klonar underordnad ID.\n"
"Användning: clone-inferior [-copies <N>] [ID]\n"
"Lägger till N kopior av underordnad ID.  Den nya underordnade har samma\n"
"körbara fil laddad som den kopierade underordnade.  Om -copies inte anges,\n"
"läggs 1 kopia till.  Om ID inte anges, är det den aktuella underordnade\n"
"som klonas."

